Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; 把 your-cert-cn / 203.0.113.10 换成实际值后再导入；双击后重启 Edge。

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\SOFTWARE\Policies\Microsoft\Edge\AutoSelectCertificateForUrls]
"1"="{\"pattern\":\"https://203.0.113.10:8443\",\"filter\":{\"SUBJECT\":{\"CN\":\"your-cert-cn\"},\"ISSUER\":{\"CN\":\"personalDemo Intermediate CA\",\"O\":\"personalDemo\",\"C\":\"CN\"}}}"
